      12 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِعْشَوْشَبَتِ الأَرْضُ</span></b>  <i>The land produced abundance,</i> or <i>much, of</i> [<i>herbs,</i> or <i>herbage, of the kind
termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشْب</span>; this verb having an intensive signification, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخشوشن</span> [q. v.]. (S, O, TA.) [It
is erroneously mentioned in the K as syn. with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْشَبَت</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 4.

